  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan became one of eight pilot countries for One UN in 2008. The first One Programme (2008 &#x2013; 2012) was signed in 2009. A second generation One Programme II (2013 &#x2013; 2017) continues the One UN reform process. The One Programme encompasses the developments strategies of all the UN agencies operating in Pakistan. Through an extensive prioritization and consultation process coupled with an analysis</narrative>
  </description>
